    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vextorial</strong> is a Multi-Dimensional puzzle-platformer where you play as Pilo, a 2D creature exploring a 3D space. Solve unique mind-bending puzzles by shifting gravity around you to explore an ancient ruin and uncover the mystery of your lost memories. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/e22149c6d56c503209fa7062d71b24c9.avif?t=1754217510\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Throughout the adventure you will:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover lore of the enigmatic realm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/e59fb283c924b254cd6add3e8bb9e052.poster.avif?t=1754217510\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/e59fb283c924b254cd6add3e8bb9e052.webm?t=1754217510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/e59fb283c924b254cd6add3e8bb9e052.mp4?t=1754217510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate across planes of a 3D cube</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/da2065c924536b0cca3e7de1fa5150c3.poster.avif?t=1754217510\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/da2065c924536b0cca3e7de1fa5150c3.webm?t=1754217510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/da2065c924536b0cca3e7de1fa5150c3.mp4?t=1754217510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate GRAVITY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/bdeaa37e2a55de8183272ca480f268d2.poster.avif?t=1754217510\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/bdeaa37e2a55de8183272ca480f268d2.webm?t=1754217510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/bdeaa37e2a55de8183272ca480f268d2.mp4?t=1754217510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve Meta-Puzzles in hub areas to progress through the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/d20ba9d56fe55043d2429bb3dd1a3ed4.poster.avif?t=1754217510\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/d20ba9d56fe55043d2429bb3dd1a3ed4.webm?t=1754217510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/d20ba9d56fe55043d2429bb3dd1a3ed4.mp4?t=1754217510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>DISCORD Community Server</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get our custom emojis on Discord!\u00a0<strong>Link on 